  "prefLabel": "Per 102.46 Increment date",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.46 “Increment date” means the date on which an employee is eligible for an increase in pay by advancing from one step to the next within the established pay range for their position.\n\nSource. #10801, eff 5-17-15; renumbered by #13667 (formerly Per 102.35); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.40), eff 12-1-25",
